      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "mms_eikonal",
          "description": "Manufactured solution g(x,y) = sin(2 pi x) + sin(2 pi y), S = 1. Derivation: u_t = -S|grad u| + S|grad g| with u(0) = g gives u_t = 0 at the continuous level, so g is the exact solution for all t; discretely u_t = S*(|grad g| - godunov(u)) and the initial imbalance is the truncation error S*(|grad g| - godunov(g)) = O(h), so u drifts from g at O(h) and ||u(T) - g|| = O(h). References evaluate g at the cell centers x_i = (i - 1/2)/NX, y_j = (j - 1/2)/NY, spelled inline per esm-spec 6.6.5 (build-time evaluation folds literals and the metaparameters NX,NY only). The t=0 assertion pins the ic wiring (L2_error 0 within 1e-9). The t=0.2 assertion bounds the first-order error (about 0.039 L2 at NX=NY=64, comfortably under the 0.1 cap, which holds across the sweep). Exact per-resolution L2/Linf errors are pinned in tests/conformance/convergence/godunov_norm_2d_eikonal_mms/golden/errors.json; the observed order is asserted to be 1.0 +/- 0.15 by scripts/check_convergence_order.py.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.2
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 1e-09
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "aggregate",
                "output_idx": [
                  "i",
                  "j"
                ],
                "args": [],
                "ranges": {
                  "i": {
                    "from": "x"
                  },
                  "j": {
                    "from": "y"
                  }
                },
                "expr": {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "sin",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            6.283185307179586,
                            {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "-",
                                  "args": [
                                    "i",
                                    0.5
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "/",
                                  "args": [
                                    1,
                                    "NX"
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "sin",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            6.283185307179586,
                            {
